WEBVTT

00:00:06.550 --> 00:00:09.970
Why don't you know that? I'm done.

00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:13.050
Wait a minute!

00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:17.260
I don't want to continue fighting.

00:00:17.670 --> 00:00:19.260
I'm begging you to please tell me.

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:21.880
Since I can't read the atmosphere
and I'm bad at guessing,

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:23.800
if you don't just tell me directly, I won't understand!

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:27.050
If you think about it normally, you'll understand.

00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:29.880
The problem isn't in whether
you can read the atmosphere or not.

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:32.170
You're wrong! I really don't understand!

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:35.470
I don't have that skill,
so that's why I'm in this current situation!

00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:37.220
That's just an excuse.

00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:37.840
No...

00:00:38.090 --> 00:00:40.130
It's you that doesn't understand how I feel!

00:00:43.420 --> 00:00:44.300
Hey!

00:00:44.470 --> 00:00:47.550
No! What she just said wasn't out of hate!

00:00:47.550 --> 00:00:49.920
But if I really think about it, I hear nothing but hate.

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:52.970
I'm so stupid!

00:02:25.010 --> 00:02:29.010
Episode 6
About the way I apologize.

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:34.630
Gardening really does calm you down after all.

00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:41.840
Morning, Ayado. Starting early with the hard work, huh?

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:44.010
G-good morning!

00:02:44.470 --> 00:02:47.970
Thank you so much for cheering me up yesterday!

00:02:47.970 --> 00:02:50.220
Nah, that didn't really cheer you up, did it?

00:02:50.630 --> 00:02:52.510
If anything, I'm sorry for saying something strange.

00:02:52.760 --> 00:02:55.840
Oh, no, I was very happy!

00:02:55.840 --> 00:02:59.920
I was thinking I would live on with pride in my body.

00:03:00.130 --> 00:03:02.050
I see, that's good.

00:03:03.510 --> 00:03:05.090
You really like those, don't you?

00:03:05.090 --> 00:03:07.630
Yes. Plants are nice.

00:03:07.970 --> 00:03:12.920
If you lovingly take care of them,
they grow quickly and they respond to you simply.

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:15.880
They aren't difficult, like humans.

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:19.590
It's like they're looking at me, somehow...

00:03:21.970 --> 00:03:22.970
I have to go...

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:24.970
Huh? Please, wait!

00:03:25.670 --> 00:03:27.050
Um, here.

00:03:27.170 --> 00:03:30.260
Here are some potatoes I harvested! Please take them!

00:03:30.260 --> 00:03:30.920
What?

00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:32.300
As thanks for yesterday!

00:03:32.670 --> 00:03:35.840
Th-thanks... Bye.

00:03:37.090 --> 00:03:38.420
Hey, Senpai!

00:03:39.130 --> 00:03:43.720
It seems like today will be a good day
since I've been talking to someone since morning!

00:03:46.380 --> 00:03:48.970
It's nice that Ayado is honest.

00:03:49.420 --> 00:03:51.220
Compared to her, I'm...

00:03:53.170 --> 00:03:57.220
But I have no idea what I should do to make it up to her!

00:03:57.550 --> 00:04:00.420
I mean, I don't understand
why she was angry from the start!

00:04:00.670 --> 00:04:02.920
Even if I try to apologize I have no way to do that!

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:05.300
Isn't this kinda Nintendo Hard?!

00:04:05.510 --> 00:04:06.300
Hey!

00:04:06.420 --> 00:04:11.010
You knew from the beginning
that you can't get an answer to this problem

00:04:11.010 --> 00:04:13.050
by thinking about it on your own, you otaku!

00:04:13.050 --> 00:04:15.380
Use all of that brain tissue you can!

00:04:18.720 --> 00:04:21.630
Oh, I can't. I have something to do.

00:04:22.090 --> 00:04:23.090
Today, too?

00:04:23.090 --> 00:04:23.970
Yeah.

00:04:25.550 --> 00:04:29.220
Don't worry about me and you and Igarashi. Eat together!

00:04:29.380 --> 00:04:31.800
Easy for you to tell us to eat together...

00:04:31.970 --> 00:04:34.260
Currently
in
 a
 fight
with
 Iroha

00:04:34.760 --> 00:04:38.760
Since that isn't a situation that I have control over
I thought I'd get some advice, but...

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:41.050
I guess I'll also eat alone today.

00:04:41.720 --> 00:04:44.760
But Ito's sure had a lot of things to do lately.

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:48.470
He couldn't be... just concerned
about my situation, right?

00:04:49.630 --> 00:04:51.970
Mewgarl, Mewgarl~

00:04:53.300 --> 00:04:56.510
I brought a can of cat food today, do you like that?

00:04:59.170 --> 00:05:01.010
You're so cute, Mewgarl.

00:05:01.220 --> 00:05:04.170
Oh, that's right. I bought a new game.

00:05:04.170 --> 00:05:06.260
Ito's talking to a cat!

00:05:06.550 --> 00:05:09.920
I've been looking forward to this new release
from the series since forever.

00:05:09.920 --> 00:05:12.010
It's an RPG with amazing visuals...

00:05:12.010 --> 00:05:13.010
I-Ito!

00:05:13.220 --> 00:05:14.550
Whoa! Tsutsui?

00:05:14.550 --> 00:05:15.670
I'm sorry, Ito!

00:05:16.010 --> 00:05:19.800
Lately there's just been so much going on,
that I couldn't give you attention!

00:05:19.800 --> 00:05:24.800
But... I didn't know I've caused you to become this lonely!

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:27.550
I-I'm not especially all that...

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:32.340
I've always liked cats, I-I'm not that lonely at all, no way!

00:05:32.340 --> 00:05:34.550
Then why are you talking to a cat about games?

00:05:34.550 --> 00:05:39.300
Keep in mind, a cat generally won't understand what
you say much less a whole conversation about games!

00:05:39.300 --> 00:05:40.300
That isn't true!

00:05:40.300 --> 00:05:44.010
Yes it is! If you're talking about games,
talk to me, not that cat!

00:05:44.010 --> 00:05:44.970
I'll always listen to you!

00:05:44.970 --> 00:05:46.470
You're dumb, Tsutsui!

00:05:46.840 --> 00:05:51.300
That's insensitive! Me coming here
doesn't have anything in particular to do with you!

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:54.590
And what do you mean by you
"couldn't give attention" to me?

00:05:54.720 --> 00:05:56.800
Tsutsui, you've been pretty arrogant lately!

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:02.510
Ito... got angry...

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:09.630
Indeed, I'm acting like a real big shot, aren't I...?

00:06:10.550 --> 00:06:13.670
It's fine if Ito has his own world, right?

00:06:13.970 --> 00:06:18.090
And even when he makes new friends,
if that friend is a cat, it's fine, right?

00:06:18.550 --> 00:06:20.470
What in the world did I do?!

00:06:20.720 --> 00:06:22.840
It's like Ito's all alone.

00:06:23.510 --> 00:06:28.220
If no text from her comes as usual,
and there's no reply from Ito either...

00:06:28.300 --> 00:06:31.340
I'm
Lonely

00:06:29.510 --> 00:06:30.970
I'm lonely...

00:06:32.130 --> 00:06:37.050
If I get no correspondence from those two,
I am all alone in the cosmos!

00:06:45.340 --> 00:06:46.420
A potato...

00:06:58.550 --> 00:06:59.760
It's no good.

00:06:59.970 --> 00:07:02.090
The loneliness won't stop.

00:07:02.840 --> 00:07:08.130
I wonder why... It had always been normal
for me to be alone...

00:07:08.840 --> 00:07:11.630
SHINDAN JUNIOR HIGH

00:07:16.800 --> 00:07:18.720
We're in the same class again!

00:07:18.720 --> 00:07:19.970
I'm so glad!

00:07:19.970 --> 00:07:22.630
We have that homeroom teacher again?!
Oh, found her. Over here, over here!

00:07:30.130 --> 00:07:31.220
Do you need something?

00:07:31.590 --> 00:07:35.920
S-sorry, I didn't know the proper time
to greet you since you're buried in your reading.

00:07:36.970 --> 00:07:41.470
This is the first time we're in the same class, huh?
I'm Ito. Nice to meet you.

00:07:45.300 --> 00:07:46.720
Uh, what?

00:07:46.970 --> 00:07:49.840
Hey, Ito, show me your worksheet.

00:07:49.840 --> 00:07:50.720
'Kay!

00:07:50.970 --> 00:07:53.630
It's great that I'm still in the same class as you!

00:07:53.760 --> 00:07:56.920
Yeah! I'm happy I'm with you too, Machida!

00:07:57.220 --> 00:08:00.010
We're in the same class again, huh, Tsutsui.

00:08:00.760 --> 00:08:03.970
Don't ignore me, otaku. Say something.

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:07.260
You came here to pick a fight about anything
because just like always you have nothing to do, huh?

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:14.590
Wh-what was that tyrannical act?

00:08:14.800 --> 00:08:16.050
Oh, that guy.

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:19.880
He's super gloomy and looks like an otaku,
so you shouldn't get involved with him.

00:08:19.880 --> 00:08:21.260
Uh, but-

00:08:21.260 --> 00:08:22.760
More importantly, that worksheet...

00:08:23.050 --> 00:08:24.550
Oh, yeah.

00:08:32.420 --> 00:08:34.170
Um... here.

00:08:34.920 --> 00:08:36.550
It fell over there.

00:08:38.720 --> 00:08:42.800
Thanks, but you're bothering me.

00:08:43.050 --> 00:08:47.510
Wha-?! Y-you might hate interacting with people,

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:49.970
but I think you could be more careful
with your word choices!

00:08:52.170 --> 00:08:53.130
Hey!

00:08:53.130 --> 00:08:55.920
Stop looking like talking about this is a waste.

00:08:56.340 --> 00:09:00.670
Why are you trying to correct me even though
I have no plans to hang out with you in the future?

00:09:04.300 --> 00:09:07.090
MAKING BANNERS
TO WELCOME NEW STUDENTS

00:09:07.670 --> 00:09:09.670
Are there any volunteers?

00:09:09.670 --> 00:09:11.550
Ugh, what a pain!

00:09:11.630 --> 00:09:15.010
They're gonna have to stay here after class, right?
Someone do it, c'mon!

00:09:15.260 --> 00:09:18.590
Ito, don't you like to do these things, like making stuff?

00:09:18.590 --> 00:09:19.130
Huh?!

00:09:19.260 --> 00:09:22.760
It doesn't matter who, someone just do it!
We can't go home until you do!

00:09:25.840 --> 00:09:29.470
Okay then... I'll do it.

00:09:29.470 --> 00:09:30.720
Alright!

00:09:31.010 --> 00:09:34.720
But not just Ito by himself.
We need at least one more person...

00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:36.840
Well then Tsutsui will do it.

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:37.720
Huh?

00:09:41.470 --> 00:09:43.470
Is he really not coming?

00:09:44.470 --> 00:09:46.380
But I'll have to do this alone...

00:09:46.590 --> 00:09:48.340
White

00:09:46.590 --> 00:09:48.340
Red

00:09:48.670 --> 00:09:51.510
Well, I guess he really isn't coming, huh?

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:53.550
Alright, here I go.

00:09:54.220 --> 00:09:59.970
Sorry! During gym my indoor shoes disappeared,
and I was looking for them, so I'm late.

00:10:00.800 --> 00:10:02.130
Where should we start?

00:10:02.670 --> 00:10:06.470
White

00:10:02.670 --> 00:10:06.470
Red

00:10:03.510 --> 00:10:06.050
Um, well...

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:22.050
Sorry, I thought you had ditched me.

00:10:22.510 --> 00:10:25.380
Yeah, well, I might have done that.

00:10:26.380 --> 00:10:28.720
But since you found my headphones for me...

00:10:33.630 --> 00:10:36.380
It really is great that we're in the same class as Ito, right?

00:10:36.380 --> 00:10:37.090
Why?

00:10:37.090 --> 00:10:40.170
Because it's alright to make him
do all of the annoying stuff.

00:10:40.420 --> 00:10:43.090
And it's seriously convenient
that you can copy straight from his homework.

00:10:43.090 --> 00:10:45.220
What?! You can totally use Ito!

00:10:45.220 --> 00:10:46.380
I know, right?

00:10:48.920 --> 00:10:53.420
It's fine, I get it. I knew they thought of me like that.

00:10:53.800 --> 00:10:59.050
But, i-if you're useful to your friends,
I think that's totally okay.

00:10:59.050 --> 00:11:00.760
"Be more careful with your word choices."

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:03.920
Aren't you gonna tell him that?

00:11:06.590 --> 00:11:10.260
It's gotten dark. This is about enough for today, right?

00:11:23.420 --> 00:11:24.340
Bye.

00:11:25.550 --> 00:11:26.970
Don't you have an umbrella?

00:11:27.300 --> 00:11:28.220
No.

00:11:31.590 --> 00:11:35.170
You think that I'm being bothersome and nosey, right?

00:11:35.760 --> 00:11:39.010
Well, I don't think that you treating me kindly
is a good thing.

00:11:39.010 --> 00:11:43.090
I-I don't particularly treat people kindly
for my own benefit!

00:11:44.170 --> 00:11:46.090
Or maybe I'm wrong...

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:50.630
Since I'm thinking "I don't want
to be hated by Machida and his friends,"

00:11:51.010 --> 00:11:53.550
there are a lot of things I can't refuse to do.

00:11:54.630 --> 00:11:57.510
Are those guys really that necessary to you?

00:12:01.220 --> 00:12:04.720
I don't think you'll die or anything if people hate you.

00:12:07.090 --> 00:12:09.880
It's kind of convincing when you say it.

00:12:10.340 --> 00:12:11.840
I'll go off on my own here.

00:12:12.630 --> 00:12:14.760
Huh?! But the rain is still heavy.

00:12:15.340 --> 00:12:17.630
I have a small towel so you can cover your head-

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:23.050
I think it's good if you can make your kindness
into this sort of thing that can be properly returned.

00:12:33.380 --> 00:12:34.840
Hey, Tsutsui.

00:12:35.510 --> 00:12:37.380
Is this type of thing interesting?

00:12:38.720 --> 00:12:40.090
Morning, Ito.

00:12:40.090 --> 00:12:42.590
Ito, did you do the handout from yesterday?

00:12:42.590 --> 00:12:44.010
Uh, yeah...

00:12:44.220 --> 00:12:45.300
Then lemme see it.

00:12:46.130 --> 00:12:47.340
I just bought that!

00:12:47.340 --> 00:12:49.300
Oh? Then since you just bought it...

00:12:49.300 --> 00:12:49.840
Stop it!

00:12:50.670 --> 00:12:51.130
WELCOME NEW STUDENTS

00:12:55.010 --> 00:12:58.550
I think it's good if you can make it into something
that can be properly returned.

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:58.840
I think it's good if you can make it

00:12:55.180 --> 00:12:58.840
into something that can be properly returned

00:12:58.970 --> 00:13:02.300
Ito, this one is from another subject... Hey!
You watch this kind of anime, huh?

00:13:02.670 --> 00:13:03.760
Stop it!

00:13:09.340 --> 00:13:10.630
What the hell are you doing?!

00:13:17.760 --> 00:13:20.800
Is it normally that easy to beat up on someone?

00:13:21.630 --> 00:13:23.470
Because they get needlessly involved.

00:13:23.800 --> 00:13:27.090
One issue of Animeid is 800 yen. I can't allow that.

00:13:27.090 --> 00:13:28.630
Wh-why do you know that?!

00:13:29.630 --> 00:13:31.970
You're not the only chunibyo here.

00:13:32.300 --> 00:13:36.630
I decided on my own to give up so many things...
And that just wasn't honest.

00:13:42.920 --> 00:13:44.670
I'll make it up to you!

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:48.470
Because I'm going to hang out with you from now on!

00:13:56.050 --> 00:13:59.340
I don't think you'll die or anything if people hate you.

00:13:59.920 --> 00:14:01.470
Nope, you'll die.

00:14:03.130 --> 00:14:05.380
If Ito hates me now,

00:14:05.970 --> 00:14:07.920
I'm going to die.

00:14:13.380 --> 00:14:14.380
Ito.

00:14:15.630 --> 00:14:17.010
It was all my fault.

00:14:17.670 --> 00:14:20.920
When I thought that I had lost to a cat, I was lonely.

00:14:22.800 --> 00:14:27.510
So I tried to set myself straight, but when
I was away from you, I was the one who was lonely.

00:14:30.260 --> 00:14:35.920
Well, I'm okay if you're happy,
and I want to interfere as little as possible.

00:14:36.340 --> 00:14:39.800
But honestly, I really was a little lonely, too.

00:14:40.220 --> 00:14:41.220
Right.

00:14:41.220 --> 00:14:43.420
I really don't think you were arrogant or anything.

00:14:44.130 --> 00:14:48.170
Well, even when you're dealing with things
and someone says "You're dealing with things, right?"

00:14:48.170 --> 00:14:49.800
you can't be honest with them.

00:14:50.970 --> 00:14:52.670
Yeah, I get it.

00:14:54.720 --> 00:14:57.590
I made potato dumplings. Let's eat them together.

00:14:58.300 --> 00:14:59.130
Okay.

00:14:59.970 --> 00:15:01.130
She sure is cute.

00:15:01.130 --> 00:15:02.300
I call her "Mewgarl."

00:15:02.300 --> 00:15:03.720
Oh, Mewgarl...

00:15:13.170 --> 00:15:16.260
Uh, even though I still don't know
the reason why she's angry,

00:15:16.260 --> 00:15:18.920
I came here on the wave of momentum
from being able to make up with Ito!

00:15:18.920 --> 00:15:20.420
It really is impossible!

00:15:20.590 --> 00:15:21.800
I'm gonna start over!

00:15:24.510 --> 00:15:25.420
Idiot.

00:15:29.800 --> 00:15:33.470
I really don't want to see her angry face.

00:15:44.300 --> 00:15:47.420
I decided to look up her address and come to her house.

00:15:48.090 --> 00:15:53.010
That's kind of stalker-like.
No, this is totally like a stalker! I'm a stalker!

00:15:53.010 --> 00:15:54.340
Alright, I'll go home after all.

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:56.880
Tsutsun...

00:15:57.300 --> 00:15:58.760
Uh, why...?

00:15:58.760 --> 00:16:01.760
Because I saw you standing
completely still in front of my house.

00:16:01.970 --> 00:16:05.630
Sorry I just came here.
Am I being gross right now? Is this okay?

00:16:05.630 --> 00:16:08.090
It's okay. What do you want?

00:16:13.590 --> 00:16:14.510
Here.

00:16:15.630 --> 00:16:16.720
What?

00:16:16.720 --> 00:16:17.670
It's a dumpling.

00:16:17.840 --> 00:16:18.720
Huh?

00:16:19.260 --> 00:16:22.670
I got a whole lot of potatoes... so I made these.

00:16:24.220 --> 00:16:25.800
I want to apologize...

00:16:26.470 --> 00:16:30.840
but it turns out if I don't know
what you're angry about, I can't do that.

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:33.760
Bye.

00:16:33.760 --> 00:16:34.550
Wait.

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:40.630
If you do that type of thing, I'll look like the idiot
for being mad the whole time.

00:16:42.170 --> 00:16:43.340
Come upstairs.

00:16:44.800 --> 00:16:45.470
What?

00:16:48.970 --> 00:16:52.590
Huh? This is my first time in a girl's room!

00:17:05.010 --> 00:17:07.090
What... are you doing?

00:17:07.550 --> 00:17:09.050
Don't mind me.

00:17:09.590 --> 00:17:10.630
I do, though.

00:17:23.550 --> 00:17:27.590
Wait a second... Are you always wearing something
that exposes this much of you at home?!

00:17:27.590 --> 00:17:28.920
Yeah? I am at home...

00:17:28.920 --> 00:17:29.590
You can't!

00:17:32.130 --> 00:17:33.510
Hey, why're you laughing?

00:17:33.510 --> 00:17:35.010
No... Sorry.

00:17:36.510 --> 00:17:39.630
It's like... I don't care about being angry anymore.

00:17:40.010 --> 00:17:44.760
I was angry because I thought you didn't trust me.

00:17:45.220 --> 00:17:49.420
Up till now, even though you came to show
that you liked me in your own way,

00:17:49.420 --> 00:17:52.260
it seemed like you still didn't believe me.

00:17:52.630 --> 00:17:55.760
There's no way I couldn't trust you...

00:17:55.970 --> 00:17:59.630
I only can't believe it in these unexpected situations.

00:18:00.300 --> 00:18:03.720
It's just that everyone isn't aware of the good in you.

00:18:04.090 --> 00:18:07.380
I'm lucky that I was found by you, Tsutsun.

00:18:08.510 --> 00:18:11.920
How many more times do I have to tell you
I love you for you, to believe me?

00:18:22.880 --> 00:18:24.510
I don't believe it...

00:18:25.510 --> 00:18:28.590
I don't believe that I am this happy.

00:18:32.970 --> 00:18:33.720
Huh?

00:18:34.170 --> 00:18:36.670
Er... Um, this is...

00:18:37.420 --> 00:18:39.800
3.14159265358-

00:18:43.010 --> 00:18:46.260
She's so very soft... and smells so nice...

00:18:54.920 --> 00:18:55.920
I can't!

00:19:08.130 --> 00:19:10.300
S-sorry! I'm really sorry!

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:18.590
I-I'm going home.

00:19:26.670 --> 00:19:28.720
I-I lost all my sense!

00:19:28.720 --> 00:19:31.050
Idiot! What the hell am I doing?!

00:19:31.050 --> 00:19:33.470
It's me who's dangerous, not the visitors!

00:19:33.470 --> 00:19:35.420
I'm afraid of myself!

00:19:49.220 --> 00:19:50.340
Morning.

00:19:53.380 --> 00:19:54.260
Morning!

00:19:54.590 --> 00:19:56.260
Don't come near me for the time being!

00:19:59.130 --> 00:20:01.380
So he's being extreme again...

00:20:11.130 --> 00:20:12.260
Ayado.

00:20:12.260 --> 00:20:13.420
Senpai!

00:20:16.510 --> 00:20:20.340
These are dumplings I made with
the potatoes you shared with me a couple days ago.

00:20:20.340 --> 00:20:21.760
Have one, if you'd like.

00:20:21.760 --> 00:20:24.130
Th-they're homemade?! Can I really?!

00:20:24.340 --> 00:20:25.220
Yeah.

00:20:27.170 --> 00:20:29.470
Ayado, you've kind of calmed down, huh?

00:20:29.630 --> 00:20:35.420
S-senpai, you're such a wonderful guy!
I can't believe you can do something like this!

00:20:51.970 --> 00:20:55.880
That potato... So he got that from her.

00:20:58.090 --> 00:21:02.260
Igarashi, morning! What are you doing
in a place like this?

00:21:03.170 --> 00:21:04.300
Ishino...

00:21:06.720 --> 00:21:08.970
Did something happen, Igarashi?

00:21:15.260 --> 00:21:18.130
Why did this happen?
